flowchart TD
    A[User question] --> B{Question type?}
    B -->|General career knowledge| C[Chatbot Baseline Path]
    C --> D[Answer from general LLM knowledge]
    B -->|Personalized career fit| E[ReAct Agent Path]
    E --> F[assess_career_fit]
    F --> G{Need learning path?}
    G -->|Yes| H[suggest_learning_path]
    G -->|No| I[Final Answer]
    H --> I
    B -->|Unrealistic guarantee or unsafe claim| J[Guardrail Path]
    J --> K[check_goal_realism]
    K --> L[Safe fallback answer]
    I --> M[Trace log and evaluation]
    D --> M
    L --> M
